03:12.380 --> 03:13.710
<b>The envelope with the request is gone!</b>

03:14.210 --> 03:17.460
<b>The one you said you would turn down?</b>

03:17.880 --> 03:19.470
<b>Where's Violet?</b>

03:19.470 --> 03:22.470
<b>She left this morning, saying she had work to do.</b>

03:22.760 --> 03:27.350
<b>I think she mentioned going to Ctrigall, and that's a week-long trip each way.</b>

03:27.720 --> 03:28.600
<b>Crap.</b>

04:00.260 --> 04:02.760
<b>I hear you, but we still can't.</b>

04:03.260 --> 04:04.590
<b>Please.</b>

04:04.590 --> 04:07.890
<b>Like I said, that's outside our delivery area.</b>

04:07.890 --> 04:09.850
<b>What's all this ruckus?</b>

04:09.850 --> 04:14.400
<b>Boss, this woman wants us to deliver her to this place.</b>

04:16.520 --> 04:18.020
<b>The Menace base?</b>

04:18.520 --> 04:21.490
<b>And you're from Leidenschaftlich?</b>

04:21.740 --> 04:23.320
<b>No wonder you're dressed so lightly.</b>

04:24.320 --> 04:25.870
<b>Now look here, missy.</b>

04:25.870 --> 04:29.160
<b>This is the Menace base,
where you want to be delivered.</b>

04:29.990 --> 04:32.250
<b>And over here, there's an internment camp.</b>

04:32.830 --> 04:35.540
<b>Or well, there used to be.</b>

04:35.920 --> 04:37.040
<b>Did they run away?</b>

04:37.790 --> 04:40.800
<b>Looks like they had some outside help.</b>

04:41.130 --> 04:44.800
<b>And we have a faction that wants to continue the War, too.</b>

04:45.130 --> 04:49.220
<b>They handed weapons to the Gardariki stragglers in the internment camp,</b>

04:49.220 --> 04:53.180
<b>making a mess of everything and throwing us into civil war.</b>

04:54.060 --> 04:57.190
<b>The Menace base is barely hanging in there as our last line of defense,</b>

04:57.190 --> 05:00.820
<b>but the roads around it have been blockaded, cutting off reinforcements.</b>

05:01.440 --> 05:02.900
<b>Get it now?</b>

05:02.900 --> 05:06.820
<b>The place you want to go is a bona fide battlefield.</b>

05:09.490 --> 05:17.080
<b>But isn't that exactly why the soldiers there would want to express their feelings to others?</b>

05:17.330 --> 05:21.500
<b>Yeah, but not even an ant could crawl into that base in one piece.</b>

05:22.050 --> 05:22.920
<b>No.</b>

05:22.920 --> 05:27.130
<b>This mountain is steep and extremely difficult to cross on foot.</b>

05:27.890 --> 05:31.560
<b>As such, neither army will be keeping close watch on it.</b>

05:31.560 --> 05:34.180
<b>B-But crossing that mountain is...</b>

05:34.680 --> 05:35.980
<b>Possible.</b>

05:35.980 --> 05:39.190
<b>Given a plane and a skilled pilot.</b>

05:39.190 --> 05:44.400
<b>Not happening. Even if you got over the mountain, you'd have to be airdropped in.</b>

05:55.580 --> 05:56.960
<b>You're an amusing lass.</b>

05:57.290 --> 05:58.460
<b>I like ya.</b>

06:01.460 --> 06:04.590
<b>Oh, you're a Doll?</b>

06:04.590 --> 06:08.510
<b>Yes. If a client requests it, we shall go anywhere.</b>

06:10.260 --> 06:15.270
<b>Then I guess a postman's job is to deliver anything anywhere, anytime.</b>

06:28.030 --> 06:32.450
<b>Say, the transcontinental railroad will be finished soon, right?</b>

06:32.700 --> 06:37.200
<b>Yeah, meaning it'll take no time to get to the south.</b>

06:37.200 --> 06:40.960
<b>They say the girls down there are all beautiful.</b>

06:41.210 --> 06:43.920
<b>We'll start receiving a lot of good food too.</b>

06:44.590 --> 06:45.630
<b>The south, huh?</b>

06:46.010 --> 06:47.260
<b>Hey, Yale.</b>

06:47.260 --> 06:47.880
<b>Sir.</b>

06:49.180 --> 06:51.010
<b>Message for the company commander.</b>

06:51.010 --> 06:53.390
<b>Platoon Two will be circling around from this point.</b>

06:53.390 --> 06:54.760
<b>Circling? Got it.</b>

06:55.510 --> 06:56.810
<b>Our ETA to the mission point will be—</b>

07:04.940 --> 07:06.530
<b>Sergeant Major! Yale!</b>

07:09.280 --> 07:10.780
<b>Enemy ambush!</b>

07:11.990 --> 07:13.910
<b>Damn it! I'll get them!</b>

07:16.950 --> 07:18.120
<b>Get down!</b>

07:24.710 --> 07:25.590
<b>Shit!</b>

07:26.590 --> 07:28.090
<b>Shit!</b>

07:34.850 --> 07:36.140
<b>Aiden...</b>

07:36.640 --> 07:39.100
<b>Please don't leave me here.</b>

07:40.810 --> 07:42.560
<b>Why would I?!</b>

07:51.990 --> 07:53.410
<b>We're going home alive.</b>

07:53.740 --> 07:56.200
<b>No! I don't want to die!</b>

07:56.910 --> 07:59.040
<b>I don't want to die either!</b>

08:16.220 --> 08:18.810
<b>No... Aiden...</b>

08:19.430 --> 08:21.770
<b>Don't leave me...</b>

08:23.730 --> 08:24.900
<b>Yale!</b>

08:25.560 --> 08:26.480
<b>Yale!</b>

08:36.200 --> 08:36.990
<b>No!</b>

08:38.160 --> 08:39.160
<b>No!</b>

08:40.080 --> 08:41.660
<b>I don't want to die!</b>

08:42.000 --> 08:43.660
<b>I have to come home!</b>

08:44.640 --> 08:45.250
<b>Maria!</b>

09:13.490 --> 09:14.950
<b>I have to come home...</b>

09:22.200 --> 09:23.200
<b>There's been a battle.</b>

09:33.340 --> 09:35.220
<b>The Menace base has fallen too.</b>

09:35.590 --> 09:38.090
<b>There's no way you can go
down there. We're heading back.</b>

09:46.890 --> 09:49.480
<b>The Ctrigallan Army is so frail.</b>

09:51.400 --> 09:54.490
<b>The moderates are just a bunch of cowards.</b>

09:54.490 --> 09:59.320
<b>That's why we must show them the way once again.</b>

10:00.780 --> 10:03.040
<b>Shall we continue the hunt, then?</b>

10:04.200 --> 10:04.870
<b>A plane?</b>

10:05.200 --> 10:06.620
<b>Aren't our allies grounded right now?</b>

10:14.460 --> 10:15.130
<b>A child?</b>

10:28.890 --> 10:29.730
<b>Get her!</b>

10:37.150 --> 10:37.900
<b>Quit it.</b>

10:40.780 --> 10:43.410
<b>I recognize you,</b>

10:48.460 --> 10:51.500
<b>Leidenschaftlich's girl soldier.</b>

10:51.500 --> 10:52.710
<b>Why are you here?</b>

10:53.790 --> 10:55.090
<b>I'm sorry to ask,</b>

10:55.630 --> 10:57.210
<b>but would you please fall back?</b>

10:58.630 --> 11:00.260
<b>Fine. I get it.</b>

11:01.260 --> 11:03.180
<b>Let's go. We're no match for her.</b>

11:12.270 --> 11:14.190
<b>Are you Mister Aiden Field?</b>

11:14.820 --> 11:18.820
<b>How do you... know my name...</b>

11:21.490 --> 11:24.280
<b>I'm sorry to have kept you waiting, sir.</b>

11:34.170 --> 11:36.800
<b>Aren't you going to play, Aiden?</b>

11:36.800 --> 11:40.670
<b>Nope. Can't think of anything I'd use the money for.</b>

11:42.800 --> 11:45.600
<b>Then why not send a letter home?</b>

11:45.930 --> 11:47.600
<b>A letter? From the battlefield?</b>

11:48.100 --> 11:48.600
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:49.060 --> 11:54.940
<b>I've never written a letter in my life. I don't even know how.</b>

11:54.940 --> 11:56.440
<b>Take a look at the poster.</b>

11:57.150 --> 12:01.450
<b>It says a lovely lady will put your feelings into words in a letter.</b>

12:02.570 --> 12:04.870
<b>Hey, Aiden.</b>

12:04.870 --> 12:07.160
<b>Make sure I look good, okay?</b>

12:12.410 --> 12:13.500
<b>Aiden...</b>

12:16.340 --> 12:17.340
<b>Maria.</b>

12:23.720 --> 12:24.720
<b>Sir.</b>

12:25.180 --> 12:27.720
<b>We'll hide here for a while.</b>

12:28.430 --> 12:31.140
<b>Someone will come pick us up in the morning.</b>

12:33.140 --> 12:35.600
<b>I feel hot right now.</b>

12:36.190 --> 12:37.980
<b>This is to prevent hypothermia.</b>

12:39.480 --> 12:41.690
<b>Will you write a letter for me?</b>

12:42.320 --> 12:43.610
<b>I must focus on treating you.</b>

12:44.030 --> 12:46.620
<b>I'd rather you wrote the letter.</b>

12:47.830 --> 12:50.620
<b>I think I'm going to die soon.</b>

12:54.790 --> 12:55.620
<b>So please.</b>

12:57.540 --> 12:58.630
<b>Understood.</b>

13:05.050 --> 13:06.140
<b>Pretty.</b>

13:06.760 --> 13:09.260
<b>I'm ready, sir.</b>

13:10.260 --> 13:13.480
<b>Address it to Dad and Mom.</b>

13:14.640 --> 13:15.890
<b>Certainly.</b>

13:17.100 --> 13:19.610
<b>"Dad, Mom...</b>

13:20.730 --> 13:23.900
<b>Thank you for raising me all these years."</b>

13:25.740 --> 13:27.410
<b>Are you writing the letter?</b>

13:27.870 --> 13:30.910
<b>I'm memorizing your words with my fingers.</b>

13:31.450 --> 13:32.160
<b>I see.</b>

13:33.500 --> 13:35.910
<b>"This might be my final letter to you.</b>

13:37.920 --> 13:43.170
<b>If you two are reincarnated and marry in the next life too,</b>

13:44.210 --> 13:47.180
<b>then please have me as your son again.</b>

13:47.590 --> 13:48.800
<b>Please.</b>

13:52.220 --> 13:56.690
<b>Things weren't supposed to end this way.</b>

13:57.140 --> 14:04.190
<b>I was going to find happiness in life and show you that I had.</b>

14:04.490 --> 14:14.370
<b>So please pray a lot so that I can be your son again.</b>

14:14.370 --> 14:15.790
<b>I beg of you."</b>

14:24.210 --> 14:27.930
<b>Was it okay to use such unrefined language?</b>

14:28.590 --> 14:32.550
<b>Yes. I think it's better this way.</b>

14:33.100 --> 14:38.440
<b>Hearing you say that makes it sound true.</b>

14:40.520 --> 14:41.480
<b>Sir!</b>

15:03.960 --> 15:08.630
<b>Sir, is there anyone else you'd like to write to?</b>

15:10.510 --> 15:12.800
<b>Maria... To Maria.</b>

15:15.220 --> 15:17.310
<b>Miss Maria, yes?</b>

15:20.600 --> 15:24.230
<b>An old friend from the neighborhood.</b>

15:25.480 --> 15:28.070
<b>We'd been together since we were kids,</b>

15:28.070 --> 15:30.360
<b>and she was like a kid sister to me.</b>

15:35.660 --> 15:40.080
<b>She said she loved me, and the feeling was probably mutual.</b>

15:40.580 --> 15:44.540
<b>But I came here before I could do anything a boyfriend would do for her.</b>

15:47.250 --> 15:49.210
<b>We didn't even kiss.</b>

15:51.930 --> 15:53.760
<b>I'll put those feelings of yours</b>

15:55.140 --> 15:57.850
<b>into words in a letter.</b>

16:04.020 --> 16:07.940
<b>”Maria, are you doing well?</b>

16:10.190 --> 16:16.370
<b>Do you remember when you said you loved me?</b>

16:17.530 --> 16:22.370
<b>I was really, really happy.</b>

16:23.330 --> 16:25.960
<b>Maria... Maria...</b>

16:27.210 --> 16:30.550
<b>I want to come home to you.</b>

16:31.420 --> 16:32.880
<b>I don't want to die.</b>

16:33.430 --> 16:36.850
<b>I want to come home... to you...</b>

16:38.600 --> 16:39.350
<b>Wait for me."</b>

16:44.480 --> 16:46.100
<b>I can't open my eyes anymore.</b>

16:47.650 --> 16:49.320
<b>Are you writing this down?</b>

16:49.860 --> 16:51.690
<b>Yes, I am.</b>

16:54.360 --> 16:59.530
<b>Violet, please make sure my letters are delivered.</b>

17:01.910 --> 17:04.290
<b>And thank you for saving me.</b>

17:04.830 --> 17:05.420
<b>I...</b>

17:09.040 --> 17:10.800
<b>I'm not alone.</b>

17:12.760 --> 17:15.630
<b>I'm right here. I'm right by your side.</b>

17:17.140 --> 17:20.560
<b>Please touch me.</b>

17:30.570 --> 17:33.320
<b>I'm holding your hand, sir.</b>

17:38.740 --> 17:43.160
<b>Oh, now I feel kind of cold.</b>

17:45.790 --> 17:48.830
<b>Dad, Mom...</b>

17:57.550 --> 17:58.300
<b>Maria.</b>

18:11.440 --> 18:12.440
<b>Maria,</b>

18:12.860 --> 18:13.780
<b>kiss me.</b>

18:27.580 --> 18:28.790
<b>Thank you.</b>

18:55.480 --> 19:00.660
<b>Everything will be all right now, sir.</b>

19:02.990 --> 19:06.830
<b>I promise to deliver your letters for you.</b>

19:31.310 --> 19:33.360
<b>"From the Vandal Postal Service.</b>

19:33.360 --> 19:36.070
<b>We've recovered your item.</b>

19:36.070 --> 19:38.360
<b>It'll be returned to you intact."</b>

19:41.320 --> 19:42.240
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

19:42.240 --> 19:44.200
<b>So, when will she be back?</b>

19:44.200 --> 19:48.040
<b>They say they're taking a detour on the way, though.</b>

19:49.790 --> 19:53.500
<b>Maria! Letter from Aiden!</b>

20:14.730 --> 20:19.570
<b>I bring you this letter from Mister Aiden Field.</b>

20:31.750 --> 20:32.750
<b>No...</b>

20:38.040 --> 20:38.960
<b>Aiden!</b>

20:42.340 --> 20:43.880
<b>Aiden!</b>

21:05.700 --> 21:06.620
<b>Thank you.</b>

21:12.660 --> 21:16.000
<b>Thank you so much for bringing our son back to us!</b>

21:18.170 --> 21:20.210
<b>No, I didn't...</b>

21:21.670 --> 21:22.510
<b>Thank you.</b>

21:27.390 --> 21:28.510
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

21:32.390 --> 21:33.140
<b>No...</b>

21:34.430 --> 21:35.140
<b>No...</b>

21:35.980 --> 21:36.650
<b>No...</b>

21:40.270 --> 21:49.280
<b>No. I'm sorry I couldn't protect him.</b>

21:52.830 --> 21:57.460
<b>I'm sorry I let him die.</b>

22:02.710 --> 22:03.550
<b>I'm so sorry.</b>

